    readAloud: ["Red Leaf, Yellow Leaf by Lois Ehlert (1991); A Tree Is Nice by Janice May Udry (1956); Little Blue and Little Yellow by Leo Lionni (1959).", ""],
    story: ["God cares for creation: Genesis 1:20–31, God made the animals and people and gave them food.", "character/bible/"],
